  "description": "Reads Business Central data directly out of SQL Server native backups (.bak) and BC cloud exports (.bacpac) — no SQL Server, no restore or import, no service tier. Parses the backup container, maps database pages, walks the system catalog and decodes rows including page compression and off-page LOBs; reads bacpac model.xml schema and native-BCP data streams. Independent implementation validated against a real SQL Server.",
